  "title": "Zucchini Bread with Pineapple",
  "description": "This zucchini bread with pineapple recipe makes two moist loaves loaded with juicy raisins and crunchy walnuts in every bite — it&#39;s great for snacking.",
  "authors": [
    "Jolin"
  ],
